{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "DARK DAWN: The Chronicles of a Doll",
    "steam_appid": 2283250,
    "required_age": "18",
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DARK DAWN:The Chronicles of a Doll is a first-person game as an episodic experience where you are a kidnapping victim and you will have a realistic experience about all its most terrifying ends such as human trafficking, organ sales and the dark web. The game is an artistic protest about these crimes that are almost a taboo in video games.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EPISODICAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you can advance through the story through 5 episodes, like a television series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283250/extras/28f69e0e3117bb6a88dae56217a1a4fc.avif?t=1733876666\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BIOLOGICAL CLOCK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adjust the schedule of the day and activate key moments in the story to continue advancing. A prolonged period of induced sleep can cause death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283250/extras/5516455621a7700eec15affdb8d94ccc.avif?t=1733876666\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build things and level up to perfect your crafting techniques in order to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283250/extras/9825f15e7e88262aae72d422c88fe898.avif?t=1733876666\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HALLUCINATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The powerful sedative will make you have terrible hallucinations during the game in distorted worlds completely removed from reality. Surviving your own mind will be complex.\u00a0You could be in a toy store with animals and then it turns into a wild African savannah.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283250/extras/a3d2a73ec4eabfed8f344f6b065a60b7.avif?t=1733876666\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEPRESSIVE MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't take care of your mental state, you can panic and become a victim of your own suffering. Dark enemies will start harassing you until they finish you off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283250/extras/56f2a562bf822169e36aa227d404a16c.avif?t=1733876666\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you be able to escape this final nighmare?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DARK DAWN:The Chronicles of a Doll is a first-person game as an episodic experience where you are a kidnapping victim and you will have a realistic experience about all its most terrifying ends such as human trafficking, organ sales and the dark web. The game is an artistic protest about these crimes that are almost a taboo in video games.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EPISODICAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you can advance through the story through 5 episodes, like a television series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283250/extras/28f69e0e3117bb6a88dae56217a1a4fc.avif?t=1733876666\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BIOLOGICAL CLOCK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adjust the schedule of the day and activate key moments in the story to continue advancing. A prolonged period of induced sleep can cause death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283250/extras/5516455621a7700eec15affdb8d94ccc.avif?t=1733876666\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build things and level up to perfect your crafting techniques in order to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283250/extras/9825f15e7e88262aae72d422c88fe898.avif?t=1733876666\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HALLUCINATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The powerful sedative will make you have terrible hallucinations during the game in distorted worlds completely removed from reality. Surviving your own mind will be complex.\u00a0You could be in a toy store with animals and then it turns into a wild African savannah.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283250/extras/a3d2a73ec4eabfed8f344f6b065a60b7.avif?t=1733876666\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEPRESSIVE MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't take care of your mental state, you can panic and become a victim of your own suffering. Dark enemies will start harassing you until they finish you off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283250/extras/56f2a562bf822169e36aa227d404a16c.avif?t=1733876666\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you be able to escape this final nighmare?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Designed as an episodic experience, experience the horrors of kidnapping first-hand and try to escape in a twisted world. Can you escape?",
